OL,3,GNEWSAClosed cliff lift staff say they
OL,4,Afeel 'forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff working on one of Scarborough's
OL,7,Fmost popular attractions have said they
OL,8,Ffeel "sad and unvalued" and "forgotten
OL,9,Fabout" after it was closed for urgent
OL,10,Frepairs.
OL,12,FThe Victorian Spa Cliff Lift was shut
OL,13,Fin August after engineers identified a
OL,14,Fnumber of safety issues.
OL,16,FThomas Murray, mayor of Scarborough,
OL,17,Fsaid he was "appalled" by the way staff
OL,18,Fhad been treated, and urged North
OL,19,FYorkshire Council to "do right by the
OL,20,Femployees".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
