OL,3,GNEWSAClosed cliff lift staff say they
OL,4,Afeel 'forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Council's corporate
OL,7,Fdirector of community development, Nic
OL,8,FHarne, said the authority had spoken to
OL,9,Fstaff about alternative duties and
OL,10,Fopportunities within Scarborough Spa
OL,11,Fitself.
